            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/52583544/boost-stack-trace-not-showing-function-names-and-line-numbers"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/52583544/boost-stack-trace-not-showing-function-names-and-line-numbers",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "trying no-pie trick…",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(didn’t seem to help)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Maybe try:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "setarch `uname -m` -R /bin/bash",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "and echo 0???",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "echo 2 | sudo tee /proc/sys/kernel/randomize_va_space",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : ">>> go back and test old builds of Stroika – backtrace once worked!",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And maybe try on vanilla unix or centos?",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Review",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://www.boost.org/doc/libs/develop/doc/html/stacktrace/configuration_and_build.html"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://www.boost.org/doc/libs/develop/doc/html/stacktrace/configuration_and_build.html",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : ">> GET WORKING ON LINUX (important) and see if works  on macos.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Re-review code in _",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "type" : "em"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "DBGENG_H",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "_",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And boost stacktrace – to see about when I can access filenames",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "I HACKED FOR NOW I HTINK",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Test nbew stacktrace code on windows/unix",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "(did rebuild on stroikadev2 – see what it looks like windows/etc – and macos)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Test new backtrace and hardwired numbers I added o unix",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(better optimization some stack frames could go away)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "((just look at last r",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "See ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/9321385/valgrind-not-showing-line-numbers-in-spite-of-g-flag-on-ubuntu-11-10-virtualbo"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/9321385/valgrind-not-showing-line-numbers-in-spite-of-g-flag-on-ubuntu-11-10-virtualbo",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Maybe add --dsymutil=yes ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "To helgrind/valgrind calls and see if then it shows linenumers not hex offset for procedures (would help A LOT at understanding the messages)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "OR BETTER  - try installing",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "Try installing the libc6-dbg package.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "TRY THIS",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
